2,12H40a12,12,0,0,1,0-24H216A12,12,0,0,1,228,128ZM40,76H216a12,12,0,0,0,0-24H40a12,12,0,0,0,0,24ZM216,180H40a12,12,0,0,0,0,24H216a12,12,0,0,0,0-24Z\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"absolute transition-all duration-300 opacity-0 -rotate-90 scale-75\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\"><path d=\"M208.49,191.51a12,12,0,0,1-17,17L128,145,64.49,208.49a12,12,0,0,1-17-17L111,128,47.51,64.49a12,12,0,0,1,17-17L128,111l63.51-63.52a12,12,0,0,1,17,17L145,128Z\"></path></svg></span></button></nav></header><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-50 md:hidden bg-[#000000] transition-opacity duration-300 overflow-y-auto opacity-0 pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"sticky top-0 z-10 flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#222] bg-[#000000]/95 px-5 py-3.5 backdrop-blur-md\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"relative flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-md overflow-hidden border border-[#313131] bg-[#000000]\"><img alt=\"AIBlockList Logo\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-full w-full object-contain\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Flogo.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Flogo.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Flogo.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75\"/></span><span class=\"font-bold text-white text-base tracking-tight\">AIBlockList</span></a><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Close menu\" class=\"flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-[#272727] bg-[#181818] text-zinc-300 hover:text-white\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\"><path d=\"M208.49,191.51a12,12,0,0,1-17,17L128,145,64.49,208.49a12,12,0,0,1-17-17L111,128,47.51,64.49a12,12,0,0,1,17-17L128,111l63.51-63.52a12,12,0,0,1,17,17L145,128Z\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"flex flex-col px-5 py-5 space-y-4\"><div class=\"space-y-1\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-zinc-500 tracking-wider px-3\">Core Platform</span><a class=\"flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl px-4 py-2.5 text-base font-medium transition-colors text-zinc-200 hover:bg-[#151515] hover:text-white\" href=\"/\"><span>Intelligence</span></a><a class=\"flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl px-4 py-2.5 text-base font-medium transition-colors text-zinc-200 hover:bg-[#151515] hover:text-white\" href=\"/account-health\"><span>Health</span></a></div><div class=\"space-y-1 border-t border-[#222] pt-4\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-zinc-500 tracking-wider px-3\">Resources &amp; Governance</span><a class=\"flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl px-4 py-2 text-sm transition-colors text-zinc-400 hover:bg-[#151515] hover:text-zinc-200\" href=\"/methodology\"><span>Methodology</span></a><a class=\"flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl px-4 py-2 text-sm transition-colors bg-[#1f1f1f] text-white font-bold\" href=\"/transparency\"><span>Transparency</span><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#ff6600]\"></span></a><a class=\"flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl px-4 py-2 text-sm transition-colors text-zinc-400 hover:bg-[#151515] hover:text-zinc-200\" href=\"/api-docs\"><span>API &amp; Open Data</span></a><a class=\"flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl px-4 py-2 text-sm transition-colors text-zinc-400 hover:bg-[#151515] hover:text-zinc-200\" href=\"/appeals\"><span>Appeals &amp; Delisting</span></a><a class=\"flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl px-4 py-2 text-sm transition-colors text-zinc-400 hover:bg-[#151515] hover:text-zinc-200\" href=\"/report\"><span>Report Spammer</span></a><a class=\"flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl px-4 py-2 text-sm transition-colors text-zinc-400 hover:bg-[#151515] hover:text-zinc-200\" href=\"/about\"><span>About AIBlockList</span></a></div><div class=\"pt-4 space-y-2.5 border-t border-[#222]\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"button-md flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-[#ff6600]/40 bg-[#131209] px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-[#ff6600] font-bold text-sm\"><span class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#ff6600] animate-pulse\"></span><span>Am I Blocked? Quick Status Check</span></button><a class=\"button-md flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-[#ff6600] px-4 py-2.5 text-black font-bold text-sm\" href=\"/directory\"><span>Inspect Account Directory</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\"><path d=\"M204,64V168a12,12,0,0,1-24,0V93L72.49,200.49a12,12,0,0,1-17-17L163,76H88a12,12,0,0,1,0-24H192A12,12,0,0,1,204,64Z\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><main id=\"main-content\" class=\"pt-16 sm:pt-24\"><section class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-4 sm:py-8 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-6 sm:space-y-8\"><div class=\"max-w-[680px]\"><p class=\"caption-3 font-mono uppercase text-[#ff6600] mb-2\">Live public accountability</p><h1 class=\"heading-2 text-white\">Transparency and audit ledger</h1><p class=\"body-3 mt-3 text-zinc-400\">Every classification, external ingestion run, and appeal resolution commits to an append only SHA-256 hash chain. Private reporter and moderator identities are never published here.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#272727] bg-[#181818] p-5\"><p class=\"caption-4 text-zinc-400\">Total indexed accounts</p><p class=\"heading-4 font-mono text-white mt-2\">3,730</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#272727] bg-[#181818] p-5\"><p class=\"caption-4 text-zinc-400\">Core human verified</p><p class=\"heading-4 font-mono text-white mt-2\">2</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#272727] bg-[#181818] p-5\"><p class=\"caption-4 text-zinc-400\">External unverified assertions</p><p class=\"heading-4 font-mono text-white mt-2\">3,728</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#272727] bg-[#181818] p-5\"><p class=\"caption-4 text-zinc-400\">Silent external (0 URLs)</p><p class=\"heading-4 font-mono text-white mt-2\">2,374</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#272727] bg-[#181818] p-5\"><p class=\"caption-4 text-zinc-400\">Accounts with public URLs</p><p class=\"heading-4 font-mono text-white mt-2\">1,356</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#272727] bg-[#181818] p-5\"><p class=\"caption-4 text-zinc-400\">Meeting 2+ URL threshold</p><p class=\"heading-4 font-mono text-white mt-2\">927</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#272727] bg-[#181818] p-5\"><p class=\"caption-4 text-zinc-400\">Tombstoned deleted posts</p><p class=\"heading-4 font-mono text-white mt-2\">161</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#272727] bg-[#181818] p-5\"><p class=\"caption-4 text-zinc-400\">Preserved source conflicts</p><p class=\"heading-4 font-mono text-white mt-2\">615</p></div></div><div id=\"audit-chain\" class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#272727] bg-[#181818] p-4 sm:p-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" class=\"text-[#ff6600]\"><path d=\"M208,36H48A20,20,0,0,0,28,56v56c0,54.29,26.32,87.22,48.4,105.29,23.71,19.39,47.44,26,48.44,26.29a12.1,12.1,0,0,0,6.32,0c1-.28,24.73-6.9,48.44-26.29,22.08-18.07,48.4-51,48.4-105.29V56A20,20,0,0,0,208,36Zm-4,76c0,35.71-13.09,64.69-38.91,86.15A126.28,126.28,0,0,1,128,219.38a126.14,126.14,0,0,1-37.09-21.23C65.09,176.69,52,147.71,52,112V60H204ZM79.51,144.49a12,12,0,1,1,17-17L112,143l47.51-47.52a12,12,0,0,1,17,17l-56,56a12,12,0,0,1-17,0Z\"></path></svg><h2 class=\"title-1 text-white\">Cryptographic audit chain verification</h2></div><span class=\"caption-3 rounded-md border border-[#ff6600]/40 bg-[#131209] px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-[#ff6600]\">CHAIN VERIFIED</span></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 md:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-[#272727] bg-[#000000] p-4\"><p class=\"caption-5 text-zinc-400\">Latest Merkle root (SHA-256)</p><p class=\"caption-4 mt-1 font-mono text-zinc-200 break-all\">b186589ebd8588fe9cb1a38cf40671fb6eb66baf5a6100a7edffce911cdb5c37</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-[#272727] bg-[#000000] p-4\"><p class=\"caption-5 text-zinc-400\">Total append only audit entries</p><p class=\"title-2 mt-1 font-mono text-white\">17</p></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#272727] bg-[#181818] p-4 sm:p-8\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" class=\"text-[#ff6600]\"><path d=\"M196,35.52C177.62,25.51,153.48,20,128,20S78.38,25.51,60,35.52C39.37,46.79,28,62.58,28,80v96c0,17.42,11.37,33.21,32,44.48,18.35,10,42.49,15.52,68,15.52s49.62-5.51,68-15.52c20.66-11.27,32-27.06,32-44.48V80C228,62.58,216.63,46.79,196,35.52ZM204,128c0,17-31.21,36-76,36s-76-19-76-36v-8.46a88.9,88.9,0,0,0,8,4.94c18.35,10,42.49,15.52,68,15.52s49.62-5.51,68-15.52a88.9,88.9,0,0,0,8-4.94ZM128,44c44.79,0,76,19,76,36s-31.21,36-76,36S52,97,52,80,83.21,44,128,44Zm0,168c-44.79,0-76-19-76-36v-8.46a88.9,88.9,0,0,0,8,4.94c18.35,10,42.49,15.52,68,15.52s49.62-5.51,68-15.52a88.9,88.9,0,0,0,8-4.94V176C204,193,172.79,212,128,212Z\"></path></svg><h2 class=\"title-1 text-white\">Source federation registry</h2></div><div class=\"overflow-x-auto\"><table class=\"w-full text-left border-collapse\"><thead><tr class=\"border-b border-[#272727] caption-4 font-mono text-zinc-400\"><th class=\"py-3 pr-4\">Source</th><th class=\"py-3 pr-4\">Maintainer</th><th class=\"py-3 pr-4\">License</th><th class=\"py-3 pr-4\">Records</th><th class=\"py-3\">Status</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-[#272727] body-5\"><tr><td class=\"py-3 pr-4 text-white\">AIBlockList Core Verified</td><td class=\"py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-zinc-400\">@aiblocklist</td><td class=\"py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-zinc-400\">ODC-By-1.0</td><td class=\"py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-white\">2</td><td class=\"py-3 font-mono caption-4 text-[#ff6600]\">Core verified</td></tr><tr><td class=\"py-3 pr-4 text-white\">Blocked for AI Reply (External)</td><td class=\"py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-zinc-400\">@levelsio</td><td class=\"py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-zinc-400\">UNSPECIFIED_EXTERNAL</td><td class=\"py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-white\">3,728</td><td class=\"py-3 font-mono caption-4 text-[#ff6600]\">Isolated external</td></tr><tr><td class=\"py-3 pr-4 text-white\">Clankwall (External)</td><td class=\"py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-zinc-400\">@ryanvogel</td><td class=\"py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-zinc-400\">UNSPECIFIED_EXTERNAL</td><td class=\"py-3 pr-4 font-mono text-white\">760</td><td class=\"py-3 font-mono caption-4 text-[#ff6600]\">Isolated external</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#272727] bg-[#181818] p-4 sm:p-8\"><h2 class=\"title-1 text-white mb-4\">Three immutable charter red lines</h2><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5 body-5 text-zinc-200\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" class=\"mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-[#ff6600]\"><path d=\"M176.49,95.51a12,12,0,0,1,0,17l-56,56a12,12,0,0,1-17,0l-24-24a12,12,0,1,1,17-17L112,143l47.51-47.52A12,12,0,0,1,176.49,95.51ZM236,128A108,108,0,1,1,128,20,108.12,108.12,0,0,1,236,128Zm-24,0a84,84,0,1,0-84,84A84.09,84.09,0,0,0,212,128Z\"></path></svg><span>Never sell private user data, reporter identities, IP logs, or unverified accusations.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5 body-5 text-zinc-200\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" class=\"mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-[#ff6600]\"><path d=\"M176.49,95.51a12,12,0,0,1,0,17l-56,56a12,12,0,0,1-17,0l-24-24a12,12,0,1,1,17-17L112,143l47.51-47.52A12,12,0,0,1,176.49,95.51ZM236,128A108,108,0,1,1,128,20,108.12,108.12,0,0,1,236,128Zm-24,0a84,84,0,1,0-84,84A84.09,84.09,0,0,0,212,128Z\"></path></svg><span>Never charge fees to appeal or delist an account.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5 body-5 text-zinc-200\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" class=\"mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-[#ff6600]\"><path d=\"M176.49,95.51a12,12,0,0,1,0,17l-56,56a12,12,0,0,1-17,0l-24-24a12,12,0,1,1,17-17L112,143l47.51-47.52A12,12,0,0,1,176.49,95.51ZM236,128A108,108,0,1,1,128,20,108.12,108.12,0,0,1,236,128Zm-24,0a84,84,0,1,0-84,84A84.09,84.09,0,0,0,212,128Z\"></path></svg><span>Never paywall the core public database, transparency ledger, or open source code.</span></li></ul></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 mt-8 sm:mt-10 pb-6 sm:pb-8\"><footer class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-[#272727] bg-gradient-to-b from-[#1a1a1a] to-[#121212] px-4 py-5 sm:px-8 sm:py-10\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-[#ff6600]/50 to-transparent\"></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Scroll to top\" class=\"absolute top-4 right-4 sm:top-7 sm:right-7 rounded-xl border border-[#313131] bg-[#1F1F1F] p-2 text-zinc-400 hover:border-[#ff6600]/60 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300 cursor-pointer\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\"><path d=\"M216.49,168.49a12,12,0,0,1-17,0L128,97,56.49,168.49a12,12,0,0,1-17-17l80-80a12,12,0,0,1,17,0l80,80A12,12,0,0,1,216.49,168.49Z\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start gap-4 sm:gap-6 md:gap-10 mb-4 sm:mb-6 md:mb-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-start max-w-sm space-y-2.5 pr-12 md:pr-0\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 group\" href=\"/\"><div class=\"flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-[#313131] bg-[#000000] p-1.5 group-hover:border-[#ff6600]/60 transition-colors duration-300\"><img alt=\"AIBlockList Logo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-full w-full object-contain\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Flogo.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Flogo.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Flogo.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75\"/></div><span class=\"title-2 font-mono text-white tracking-tight\">AIBlockList<span class=\"text-[#ff6600]\">.</span></span></a><p class=\"text-[13px] leading-relaxed sm:body-6 text-zinc-400 text-pretty\">Independent, open source trust infrastructure separating automated reply spam from authentic human speech across 𝕏 and Threads.</p><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-[#272727] bg-[#000000] px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] sm:caption-5 font-mono text-zinc-400 whitespace-nowrap\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" class=\"text-emerald-400 shrink-0\"><path d=\"M208,36H48A20,20,0,0,0,28,56v56c0,54.29,26.32,87.22,48.4,105.29,23.71,19.39,47.44,26,48.44,26.29a12.1,12.1,0,0,0,6.32,0c1-.28,24.73-6.9,48.44-26.29,22.08-18.07,48.4-51,48.4-105.29V56A20,20,0,0,0,208,36Zm-4,76c0,35.71-13.09,64.69-38.91,86.15A126.28,126.28,0,0,1,128,219.38a126.14,126.14,0,0,1-37.09-21.23C65.09,176.69,52,147.71,52,112V60H204ZM79.51,144.49a12,12,0,1,1,17-17L112,143l47.51-47.52a12,12,0,0,1,17,17l-56,56a12,12,0,0,1-17,0Z\"></path></svg><span>Apache 2.0 · ODC-By 1.0 · Policy v1</span></div></div><div class=\"sm:hidden w-full rounded-xl border border-[#272727] bg-[#141414] divide-y divide-[#272727]\"><details open=\"\" class=\"group\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between px-3.5 py